Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Default,,60,60,0,,Imagine seeing colors\Nyou can't even dream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.99,Default,,60,60,0,,of. That's just\Na Tuesday for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:08.99,Default,,60,60,0,,Mantis Shrimp. These\Nvibrant ocean warriors possess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:11.98,Default,,60,60,0,,the most complex\Neyes in the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.98,0:00:14.98,Default,,60,60,0,,animal kingdom. Humans have\Nthree color-receptive cones;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:17.98,Default,,60,60,0,,Mantis Shrimp? Sixteen.\NThey can perceive ultraviolet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:20.97,Default,,60,60,0,,infrared, and even\Ncircularly polarized light. But
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:23.97,Default,,60,60,0,,their superpowers don't\Nstop there. Their raptorial
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.97,0:00:26.96,Default,,60,60,0,,claws accelerate\Nfaster than a .22 caliber
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.96,Default,,60,60,0,,bullet. The strike\Ngenerates a superheated bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.96,0:00:32.96,Default,,60,60,0,,that momentarily reaches\Nthousands of degrees Celsius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:35.95,Default,,60,60,0,,It's called a\Ncavitation bubble, and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:38.95,Default,,60,60,0,,can smash through\Naquarium glass. This tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:41.94,Default,,60,60,0,,terror, often just\Na few inches long,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:44.94,Default,,60,60,0,,is a living, breathing,\Ntechnicolor tank. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:47.94,Default,,60,60,0,,the next time\Nyou marvel at a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:50.93,Default,,60,60,0,,rainbow, consider what\Nspectrum you're truly missing.